        "id": "intro.p01",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "intro.p01.01",
            "text": "Large language models and generative AI are transforming everything around us, with startups forming around them, companies switching to them for various tasks, and jobs in the field rising rapidly.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@71",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@73",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@76",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@79",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@81",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@83",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@85"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "intro.p01.02",
            "text": "That is why learning to build an LLM from scratch matters: many people jump straight to applications and running code, but very few understand how large language models actually work or the nuts and bolts that make them powerful.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@88",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@91",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@94",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@96",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@99",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@101",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@105",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@109",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@112",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@115"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "intro.p01.03",
            "text": "Building one yourself develops confidence in the subject, and after that the application layer becomes much easier to approach.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@119",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@122",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@127",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@130",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@155",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@157",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@161",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@163",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@164",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@166"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "intro.p02",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "intro.p02.01",
            "text": "The field is worth learning because current models are far more capable than earlier systems.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@300",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@303",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@305",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@309",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@334",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@336",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@340",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@343",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@349",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@354",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@356",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@359",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@360",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@363",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@367",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@387",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@390",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@391"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "intro.p02.02",
            "text": "Open models also make the subject newly accessible, because key information is now available publicly and the gap with closed models is decreasing.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@396",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@400",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@405",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@407",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@412",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@417",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@420",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@422",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@425",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@451",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@454",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@456",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@459",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@461",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@465",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@467",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@469",
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@472"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "intro.p02.03",
            "text": "Generative AI is broader than language alone, including video, audio, and 3D models, and its practical impact already reaches real applications and a fast-growing job market.",
            "type": "F",
            "cites": [
              "Xpr8D6LeAtw@486",
